      "mergedPostDetails": "The Canny (feedback.vrchat.com) favicon uses the dimensional VRC icon.\n\nThe Zendesk (help.vrchat.com) uses the wrong version of the dimensional VRC icon with bad scaling.\n\nThe Docs (docs.vrchat.com) use an older, flat icon.\n\nThe Statuspage (status.vrchat.com) uses the default Atlassian Statuspage favicon.",
